00:10:55.924 --> 00:10:58.185
And I think the essays are,

00:10:58.185 --> 00:11:03.501
something that you can use to
stand out amongst your peer group.

00:11:03.501 --> 00:11:07.088
And I'd say like if you're
interested in the school and

00:11:07.088 --> 00:11:09.531
